// Suspicious Redirection to Local Admin Share | T1048 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_susp_redirect_local_admin_share.yml
any where process.command_line:"*>*" and (process.command_line like~ ("*\\\\127.0.0.1\\admin$\\*", "*\\\\localhost\\admin$\\*"))
